        "TileImage": "$($repository 3cf8195c-3d32-4a82-88a8-a669a0419855).Image",
        "Description": "The Liberation cult at Bangkok&apos;s Himmapan Hotel has been acting quite suspicious, and the locals want to get them off premesis as quick as possible. So a plan has been devised to combat this.\r\rUnder the guise of various cult members you are tasked with eliminating various hotel staff members and cult members equally. This should hopefully scare either side to back down and call off the exhibit.\r\rGood Luck!",
